{"reviewId": "380402079_80QPhK88i", "review": {"abstract": "结合金价在长周期中的运行规律，黄金资产在当前的长波时点具有很高的配置价值", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "刚才看了一下黄金ETF，2016年之前确实都比较平，2016年之后开始进入稳步上升，2019年增速特别明显，2022年极速飙升，16年的ETF是2块多，现在是7块5左右，十年的时间涨了三倍，但说实话，持有十年的时间，99%的人都做不到，太漫长了。我是从2024年10月开始关注黄金etf，那时候是5块7左右。然后就眼睁睁的看着它往上涨，5月份涨到8块多，然后又开始回落到现在7块多，按照这个规律，现在是长波的衰退期，那就是中途的回调，继续还会涨。现在是每盎司3000左右，卢麒元先生估计到5000元每盎司，那不得涨到2028年～30年康波的复苏期", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "5144-5180", "createTime": 1749721442, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "380402079_80QPhK88i", "userVid": 380402079, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 18, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 380402079, "name": "@雁菁💞", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-YP88sMnDO5fc6f~Xb7tXUf6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "@雁菁💞", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "文字中谋心，阅读中谋趣，烟火中谋生。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "人丑就要多读书，腹有诗书气自华。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 18, "likes": [{"userVid": 292077019, "name": "正不正", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/P7AY6icDmCzShBFEUTuxDs7sibWskl1SLbEmiakY1CP6gW12k17iaV9vRkNmMOjwMrfHiabibibSJ31JS3b7ST4miantd2Km6PFccZbkR4Xia5Zukx7w/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "is